DEADLY SHOOTING | A police officer shot and killed a homicide suspect late Monday night on SE 82nd Avenue. 

@ClackCoSheriff &amp; @PortlandPolice were chasing a person they believed to be involved in a Portland homicide. 
The chase ended outside Lazboy Furniture. 

@KGWNews https://t.co/zfmrnMvWx2

Police Officer shot in Depford, NJ.
